{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"段正淳（镇南王）","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:qingshiqiao","believed_by":["person:canon:qiaofeng"],"as_person":"person:canon:duanzhengchun","ch":[23,23],"b":"text","e":[[23,46,25,42,"1f8646f07b1bd0a8"],[23,68,136,151,"7eb54fee92f730d6"]],"note":"阿朱赶在三更之前扮成段正淳赴青石桥之约，替他挨下萧峰的一掌；萧峰在闪电中抓下她脸上的软泥才认出是她"}
{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"萧峰","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":[],"as_person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","ch":[23,23],"b":"text","e":[[23,68,97,114,"7eb54fee92f730d6"]],"note":"仅见于阿朱的自述：她假称生病，改扮成萧峰去见段正淳，传话取消当晚之约；这一扮是否瞒过对方，原文未直接交代"}
{"person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","as_name":"虬髯大汉","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:xinyang","believed_by":["*"],"ch":[23,23],"b":"text","e":[[23,205,68,75,"2e87a7193cfdb3fc"],[23,206,68,76,"3c5ca60b34b10aa3"]],"note":"萧峰在信阳客栈里自己动手，用面粉胶水与剪下的鬓发粘成虬髯并以散发遮面；随后在大堂用膳，未见有人对他起疑"}
